    description: "Found by the 2026-10-31 docstring staleness audit (dev 5f6b2af921): a reviewer flagged it and a default-REJECT verifier re-reproduced it on a fixture of its own (reports under ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/staleness_audit_10312026/review and verify). Corpus impact not measured. io_boundary.py:2608-2611 `if community or _status != CATALOG_STATUS_UNSUPPORTED` restores the fallback status, against the contract at :266-269. A ruby overlay with provenance: community gives unsupported/True/True; without the line in_progress/True/True. Faraday.post with no row reads dst_classification_unreliable False under the community overlay, True under a user overlay (_compute_external_potential :4402). WI-donod fixed the user-overlay half of this line. v04."  # 3e13
